\">\n        Creating custom luxury interiors for high-end clients is a careful, considered, and deeply artistic process. Unlike standard interior design that merely focuses... </p>\n                    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                        <!-- <span class=\"text-accent\" style=\"color: var(--accent-color);\">October 18, 2025</span> -->\n                        <a title=\"Read how we create custom luxury interiors\" href=\"/karnal/blog-how-we-create-custom-luxury-interiors-for-high-end-clients\" class=\"read-more\">\n                            View Details &rarr;\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n              <!-- Content Card 9 -->\n            <article class=\"card\">\n                <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/art6.avif\" \n                     alt=\"Luxury furniture and custom built-in solutions\" title=\"Luxury furniture and custom built-in solutions\" \n                     class=\"card-image\">\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <!-- <p class=\"category\">\n                        Category B\n                    </p> -->\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"font-family: var(--font-serif);\">\n                 Luxury Furniture & Custom Built-In Solutions-We Provide: The Complete Guide to High-End Craftsmanship\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-excerpt\">\n        Creating luxury interiors means starting with picking the right furniture and built-in solutions. For high-end clients, furniture is not just a functional solution, but it... </p>\n                    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                        <!-- <span class=\"text-accent\" style=\"color: var(--accent-color);\">October 18, 2025</span> -->\n                        <a title=\"Read about luxury furniture and custom built-in solutions\" href=\"/karnal/blog-luxury-furniture-and-custom-built-in-solutions\" class=\"read-more\">\n                            View Details &rarr;\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n             <!-- Content Card 10 -->\n            <article class=\"card\">\n                <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/rus5.avif\" \n                     alt=\"Designing luxury offices, salons, and hotels\" title=\"Designing luxury offices, salons, and hotels\" \n                     class=\"card-image\">\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <!-- <p class=\"category\">\n                        Category B\n                    </p> -->\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"font-family: var(--font-serif);\">\n                Our Process of Designing Luxury Office, Salons, and Hotels — From Vision to Reality\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-excerpt\">\n      Designing luxury commercial interiors, whether for offices, salons, or hotels, is indeed a delicate art; it is all about strategic planning, creativity, brand identity, and great craftsmanship. Unlike residences... </p>\n                    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                        <!-- <span class=\"text-accent\" style=\"color: var(--accent-color);\">October 18, 2025</span> -->\n                        <a title=\"Read about designing luxury offices, salons, and hotels\" href=\"/karnal/blog-our-process-of-designing-luxury-office-salons-and-hotels-from-vision-to-reality\" class=\"read-more\">\n                            View Details &rarr;\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n              <!-- Content Card 11 -->\n            <article class=\"card\">\n                <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1709\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/e2.avif\" \n                     alt=\"Home theatre design services for premium homes\" title=\"Home theatre design services for premium homes\" \n                     class=\"card-image\">\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <!-- <p class=\"category\">\n                        Category B\n                    </p> -->\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"font-family: var(--font-serif);\">\n              Exclusively for Premium Homes: Theatre Design Services\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-excerpt\">\n     More than just installing a big screen and speakers, creating a luxurious home theatre is all about designing an immersive environment where technology, comfort, and aesthetics come together. For premium homes, the philosophy... </p>\n                    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                        <!-- <span class=\"text-accent\" style=\"color: var(--accent-color);\">October 18, 2025</span> -->\n                        <a title=\"Read about home theatre design services\" href=\"/karnal/blog-exclusively-for-premium-homes-theatre-design-services\" class=\"read-more\">\n                            View Details &rarr;\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </section>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            console.log(\"Feature section loaded. Vanilla CSS styles are active.\");\n\n            // Get all card elements\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.card');\n\n            cards.forEach(card => {\n                // Find the existing 'read-more' link inside the card\n                const linkElement = card.querySelector('.read-more');\n                if (!linkElement) return;\n\n                const destination = linkElement.getAttribute('href');\n\n                // Make the entire card navigate when clicked\n                card.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    // Prevent navigation if the user clicks directly on the anchor tag\n                    if (e.target.closest('.read-more')) {\n                        return;\n                    }\n                    \n                    // Navigate to the destination URL stored in the link element\n                    if (destination && destination !== '#') {\n                        window.location.href = destination;\n                    } else if (destination === '#') {\n                         // For placeholder links, log the intended action instead of navigating\n                        const title = card.querySelector('.card-title').textContent;\n                        console.log(`Card clicked. Intended navigation to details for: \"${title.trim()}\" (Placeholder link: ${destination})`);\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // The original link handler is no longer needed as the card handler covers it, \n            // but we can ensure the default action is prevented for the link itself if it's clicked directly\n            const readMoreLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.read-more');\n            readMoreLinks.forEach(link => {\n                 link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    // This prevents the anchor tag from triggering navigation twice if the JS failed to prevent it\n                    // or if the destination is '#'\n                    if (link.getAttribute('href') === '#') {\n                       e.preventDefault();\n                    }\n                 });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n    "}